Package: aptsourcesctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pkexec, gpg, qt6-svg-plugins
Description: Qt 6 control panel for APT sources, keyrings and pinning
 AptSourcesCtl views and edits APT configuration on Debian: one-line
 .list and deb822 .sources repository files, signing keyrings, and
 pinning preferences. Files are edited byte-for-byte preserving comments
 and layout.
 .
 The GUI runs as the user; writes under /etc/apt go through a small
 privileged helper authorised with polkit (pkexec).
